================================================================================
SCOPE AND PROVENANCE
================================================================================

This repository contains work by more than one author, and the licence above
does not cover all of it.

The MIT licence above applies to the files written during the rebuild of this
project. In the source tree these carry the tag:

    @author @Barath-Grama

At the time of writing that is 18 files: the persistence layer (Database, the
five DAOs, the schema and its migration), the service layer (RentalService,
UserService, ServiceResult), reporting and the dashboard (ReportingDao,
Dashboard, BarChart), the table tooling (TableTools), the legacy importer
(SerImporter), the AppUser model, the Images and SaveReport helpers, the
vendored absolute-layout classes, and the whole test suite. It also covers
README.md, ENGINEERING.md, the build configuration and the screenshots in docs/.

The remaining 14 source files originate from the Rent-A-Car Management System by
Abdullah Shahid (https://github.com/AbdullahShahid01/Rent-a-Car-Management-System),
with a contribution from Saad Bin Abi Waqas. In the source tree these carry:

    @author @AbdullahShahid01

That project was published without a licence. Copyright in those files therefore
remains with their authors, and no licence for them is granted here. They have
been modified in this repository, and those modifications do not change who holds
copyright in the underlying work.

What this means in practice: the MIT grant above is the only permission this
repository can offer, and it does not extend to the inherited files. Anyone
wanting to reuse the project as a whole should approach the original author.

The image assets (LoginImage.JPG, MainMenuImage.jpeg, WelcomeImage.jpg) came with
the original project and have no stated source or licence. They are excluded from
the grant above.
